{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "description": "T21-2d / Tune31 T31-1: an inferred witness may reach a self-forwarding var raw entry, whose representation-agnostic COW setter preserves widening and boxed-wrapper fallback without promoting inference to a declared contract (D3.2.1, D3.3.3v3).",
